// HZM coop - AUDIO ENHANCEMENT SUITE aliases (any ubersound/*.scr is auto-registered).
//
// DISTANT WEAPON TAILS: layered by cgame (cg_parsemsg.cpp CG_MakeBulletTracerInternal) at the
// shooter's muzzle when a bullet volley originates > coop_distantFireDist units from the listener.
// Generous min/max distances so the tail carries across the map (the cgame already gates by range).
aliascache coop_gun_tail_rifle sound/coop_distant/tail_rifle.wav soundparms 0.9 0.1 0.95 0.1 1200 8000 auto loaded maps "m e t dm obj train"
aliascache coop_gun_tail_auto sound/coop_distant/tail_auto.wav soundparms 0.9 0.1 0.95 0.1 1200 8000 auto loaded maps "m e t dm obj train"
//
// AMBIENCE BEDS: levelwide loopsounds driven by coop_mod/ambience.scr (volume re-issued ~2s to
// track the combat-mix duck). Distances are moot for levelwide loops but kept sane as a fallback.
aliascache coop_amb_wind sound/coop_amb/amb_wind_loop.wav soundparms 1.0 0.0 1.0 0.0 160 1600 auto loaded maps "m e t dm obj train"
aliascache coop_amb_country sound/coop_amb/amb_country_loop.wav soundparms 0.65 0.0 1.0 0.0 160 1600 auto loaded maps "m e t dm obj train"
//[311] FRONTLINE distant-war beds (extracted MOH Frontline PS3 score layer; 2-3.5 min loops).
//Plain alias (not aliascache) so only the one bed a map actually picks gets loaded.
alias coop_flamb_beach sound/frontline/amb_beach.wav soundparms 0.80 0.0 1.0 0.0 160 1600 auto loaded maps "m e t dm obj train"
alias coop_flamb_port sound/frontline/amb_port.wav soundparms 0.80 0.0 1.0 0.0 160 1600 auto loaded maps "m e t dm obj train"
alias coop_flamb_town sound/frontline/amb_town.wav soundparms 0.80 0.0 1.0 0.0 160 1600 auto loaded maps "m e t dm obj train"
alias coop_flamb_country sound/frontline/amb_country.wav soundparms 0.80 0.0 1.0 0.0 160 1600 auto loaded maps "m e t dm obj train"
//[user 07-13] wave 2 beds picked by audio analysis after the user's audition pass:
//urbanwar = Arnhem street war (amb_4_3_05), countrywar = open-country battle (amb_5_4_03),
//industrial = factory drone (amb_6_2_03); all loudness-matched to the wave 1 beds.
alias coop_flamb_urbanwar sound/frontline/amb_urbanwar.wav soundparms 0.80 0.0 1.0 0.0 160 1600 auto loaded maps "m e t dm obj train"
alias coop_flamb_countrywar sound/frontline/amb_countrywar.wav soundparms 0.80 0.0 1.0 0.0 160 1600 auto loaded maps "m e t dm obj train"
